  "contentHtml": "<p>주기율표가 무엇인지 간단하게 알려주고, 같이 학습지 빈칸 채웠어요 ㅎㅎ</p><p>주기율표 시험지는 번호 순서대로 나와있어서 아이들이 시험을 잘 치는데</p><p>랜덤문제는 외운걸 생각해서 써야하니까 조금 어려워하는 학생도 있더라고요! 연습만이 살길이다!!!</p><p>유용하게 사용하세요 :-)&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b485a2a78a99b76d202254eb46b7887bb80fd55?download\" data-file-name=\"주기율표 학습지-.pdf\" data-file-size=\"23360\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D864%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20220325180821&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4b485a2a78a99b76d202254eb46b7887bb80fd55')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">주기율표 학습지-</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">22.81KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/209d9e2349f23562c5a897e3384562d332ad5162?download\" data-file-name=\"주기율표 시험지.pdf\" data-file-size=\"25992\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D864%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20220325180821&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F209d9e2349f23562c5a897e3384562d332ad5162')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">주기율표 시험지</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">25.38KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/10588bdebd40b4b7e45ad0aee6816ed48ae1adca?download\" data-file-name=\"원소기호 랜덤 문제.pdf\" data-file-size=\"19424\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D864%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20220325180821&url=https%3A%2F%2F